From: Luma Settings <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: the LumaUI window and pages as Studio v70 draws them

The one Settings window (title row, sidebar with the account card, destinations
and the search foot), the page anatomy (header, hero well, row groups, one
builder per v70 row kind) and every page, measured against Studio v70 with
lumaui-conform.

